{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514222-consuming-human-flesh","id":1514222,"title":"Consuming Human Flesh","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-08T12:15:17-07:00","id":1514222,"title":"Consuming Human Flesh","content":"So we know it's possible for a vampire - at least some of them - to consume human flesh along with the blood for extra sustenance. The Nagaraja weakness forces them to, and the Giovanni have a clan merit &quot;cannibal&quot; allows them to do it to (thanks to the under-celebrated genius of their cousins).<br /> <br /> Would you rule that this is a random quirk that occurs only in some vampires (like glowing eyes or plants wilting in your presence), a learned skill (the Dunsirn perhaps developed a tolerance through perseverance) or something all vampires can do, they just never thought to try it for multiple reasons?\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-08T13:06:22-07:00","id":1514231,"title":"","content":"I would lean towards a random quirk/developed trait, as it contradicts the general tendency for Kindreds' internal physiology to mostly wither up and become defunct; IIRC, they don't even really have a functioning stomach in most cases, and just absorb the blood they drink through osmosis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-08T13:09:31-07:00","id":1514232,"title":"","content":"I would limit it to cases of some supernatural flaw or curse. I would certainly never allow it to be something that just happens or develops, certainly not intentionally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}